  <p v-if="!value.night.length" class="missing">台指夜盤尚無可核對的成交時間或同合約日盤基準，不用舊價格補成新訊號。</p>
  <div class="overseas-grid"><article v-for="r in value.overseas" :key="r.key" :class="{old:!r.included}"><b>{{r.label}}</b><div class="row"><strong>{{fmt(r.price)}}</strong><span :class="r.change_pct<0?'fall':'rise'">{{sign(r.change_pct)}}%</span></div><small>相對來源前收 {{fmt(r.previous_close)}} · {{state(r.state)}}</small><small>{{time(r.quote_at)}}（台北）</small><a :href="safe(r.url)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{r.source}}↗</a></article></div>
  <section v-if="value.volatility" class="volatility"><h4>近期波動與振幅 · 至 {{value.volatility.as_of}} 完整日線</h4><div class="vol-grid"><p>近5日日均振幅<b>{{fmt(value.volatility.range5_pct)}}%</b><small>近20日 {{fmt(value.volatility.range20_pct)}}%；前段20日 {{fmt(value.volatility.previous20_range_pct)}}%</small></p><p>ATR14<b>{{fmt(value.volatility.atr14_points,0)}}點</b><small>約收盤 {{fmt(value.volatility.atr14_pct)}}%</small></p><p>近20日報酬波動<b>{{fmt(value.volatility.std20_daily_pct)}}%</b><small>EWMA日波動 {{fmt(value.volatility.ewma_daily_pct)}}%</small></p><p v-if="value.weekly_amplitude">本週振幅{{value.weekly_amplitude.weekly_current_confirmed?'':'（暫估）'}}<b>{{fmt(value.weekly_amplitude.weekly_current_pct)}}%</b><small>前4完整週均 {{fmt(value.weekly_amplitude.weekly_previous_4_average_pct)}}%；已確認連{{value.weekly_amplitude.weekly_confirmed_color||'綠'}} {{value.weekly_amplitude.weekly_confirmed_streak}}週</small></p></div></section>
  <details v-remember-disclosure="'v6.live.evidence'"><summary>判讀依據、觀察條件與資料限制</summary><p v-for="s in value.assessment.drivers" :key="s">{{s}}</p><p v-for="s in value.assessment.watch_next" :key="s">{{s}}</p><p v-for="e in value.errors||[]" :key="e.key" class="missing">{{e.key}}：{{e.reason}}</p><p>{{value.volatility?.note}}</p><p>只有對話更新V6才保存新資料；重整頁面不取新價。盤中報價不冒充完整日線，舊預報不改寫。</p></details>
 </section>
</template>
